.angular/*

# Other CEDAR repos belong beside this one under $CEDAR_HOME (~/CEDAR), never
# inside it — docs across the repos cross-link as ../../<repo>/..., which only
# resolves from that layout. These entries are a guard so a stray clone in here
# can't be committed as an embedded repository.
/cedar-component-demo
/cedar-development
/cedar-component-distribution
dist-types/

# The staged npm package, written by `npm run package:npm:prebuilt`. Every file in
# it is generated: the bundle from source, the declarations by `types:public`, the
# manifests by `scripts/npm-package.mjs`, and README/CHANGELOG copied from the root.
# Staging verifies each staged byte against the source it came from, and two clean
# builds of identical source were measured byte-identical, so committing the output
# as well only added a second copy that could disagree with the first — which it did,
# repeatedly, until the gate was taught to catch it. Local consumers symlink
# `node_modules/cedar-embeddable-editor` here, so this directory still has to exist
# on disk; a fresh clone needs one `npm run package:npm:prebuilt` before it does.
/dist-npm

# The TypeScript model library needs a second source manifest because its root and
# published packages have different names. CEE does not: scripts/npm-package.mjs
# derives the scoped dev or unscoped release manifest from the root version. Keep
# an accidentally copied model-library package-dist.json out of this repository.
/package-dist.json
